flowchart LR
  T[Source water tank] --> U[HC-SR04-compatible ultrasonic\nESP32 GPIO26/27]
  T --> FI[Inlet flow sensor\nESP32 GPIO25]
  FI --> E[ESP32 main controller\nLCD I2C GPIO21/22\nBuzzer GPIO14\nSolenoid relay GPIO23]
  TT[Test tube / monitored section] --> FO[Outlet flow sensor 2\nESP8266 D5 / GPIO14]
  FO --> N[ESP8266 Wi-Fi station]
  N -. HTTP JSON + sequence .-> AP[ESP32 private Wi-Fi AP\n192.168.4.1]
  AP --> E
  E --> W[Internet Wi-Fi station]
  W --> V[Vercel API\n/api/esp32/readings]
  V --> S[(Supabase)]
  V --> D[Live dashboard]
  V --> G[Telegram alerts]
  E --> A[Solenoid + buzzer fail-safe]
